&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;13回／13回　（100％）※&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;常勤監査役&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;井　川　裕　昌&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;16回／16回　（100％）&lt;/p&gt;
